#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:2
msgid "2. Layout, Typography, & Media"
msgstr "2. 布局容器、文本排版与图像媒体"

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:4
msgid ""
"Declarative Xent layouts compose Flex containers, layout modifiers, "
"scrollable viewports, inherited typography, and asynchronous WIC images."
msgstr "Xent 声明式布局由 Flex 堆栈容器、布局修饰器、可滚动视口、继承式文本排版与异步 WIC 图像组合而成。"

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:8
msgid "Flex Stacks, Cards, and ``xtk_kids``"
msgstr "Flex 堆栈容器、卡片与 ``xtk_kids``"

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:10
msgid "Four primary container builders arrange child elements:"
msgstr "四类常用构建器用于组织子元素与间隔："

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:12
msgid ""
"``xtk_column(ui, desc, children)`` — Stacks children vertically (main "
"axis: top to bottom; cross axis: horizontal)."
msgstr "``xtk_column(ui, desc, children)`` —— 纵向排列子元素（主轴自上而下，交叉轴水平）。"

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:14
msgid ""
"``xtk_row(ui, desc, children)`` — Stacks children horizontally (main "
"axis: left to right; cross axis: vertical)."
msgstr "``xtk_row(ui, desc, children)`` —— 横向排列子元素（主轴自左向右，交叉轴垂直）。"

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:16
msgid ""
"``xtk_card(ui, desc, children)`` — Vertical Fluent card container with "
"themed background fill, rounded corners, and stroke border."
msgstr "``xtk_card(ui, desc, children)`` —— 带主题背景色、圆角与描边边框的纵向 Fluent 卡片容器。"

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:18
msgid ""
"``xtk_divider(ui)`` and ``xtk_spacer(ui)`` — Visual separator line and "
"flexible empty space inside stacks."
msgstr "``xtk_divider(ui)`` 与 ``xtk_spacer(ui)`` —— 堆栈内的视觉分隔线与弹性空白占位项。"

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:21
msgid ""
"Wrap inline child elements with ``xtk_kids(...)``, which builds a "
"compound literal array terminated by the ``XTK_END`` sentinel:"
msgstr "使用 ``xtk_kids(...)`` 包裹内联子元素列表，它会自动构造以 ``XTK_END`` 哨兵结尾的复合字面量数组："

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:48
msgid "``XtkStackDesc`` Reference"
msgstr "``XtkStackDesc`` 字段说明"

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:54
msgid "Field"
msgstr "字段"

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:55
msgid "Behavior"
msgstr "作用"

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:56
msgid "``.gap``"
msgstr "``.gap``"

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:57
msgid "Logical pixel spacing inserted between adjacent visible children."
msgstr "相邻可见子元素之间的逻辑像素间距。"

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:58
msgid "``.padding``"
msgstr "``.padding``"

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:59
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``XentInsets`` inner padding in ``{left, top, right, bottom}`` order."
msgstr "按 ``{left, top, right, bottom}``（左、上、右、下）顺序排列的 ``XentInsets`` 内边距。"

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:60
msgid "``.align``"
msgstr "``.align``"

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:61
msgid ""
"Cross-axis alignment: ``XENT_FLEX_ALIGN_START``, ``CENTER``, ``END``, or "
"``STRETCH``."
msgstr "交叉轴对齐方式： ``XENT_FLEX_ALIGN_START`` 、 ``CENTER`` 、 ``END`` 或 ``STRETCH`` 。"

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:63
msgid "``.justify``"
msgstr "``.justify``"

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:64
msgid ""
"Main-axis distribution: ``XENT_FLEX_JUSTIFY_START``, ``CENTER``, ``END``,"
" ``SPACE_BETWEEN``, ``SPACE_AROUND``, or ``SPACE_EVENLY``."
msgstr ""
"主轴空间分布： ``XENT_FLEX_JUSTIFY_START`` 、 ``CENTER`` 、 ``END`` 、 ``SPACE_BETWEEN`` 、 "
"``SPACE_AROUND`` 或 ``SPACE_EVENLY`` 。"

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:66
msgid "``.wrap``"
msgstr "``.wrap``"

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:67
msgid ""
"``XENT_FLEX_NO_WRAP`` (default) or ``XENT_FLEX_WRAP`` for multi-line "
"flowing rows (such as tag chips or button toolbars)."
msgstr "默认 ``XENT_FLEX_NO_WRAP`` ；设为 ``XENT_FLEX_WRAP`` 时支持多行自动折行（如标签组或流式工具栏）。"

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:69
msgid "``.fill``"
msgstr "``.fill``"

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:70
msgid "Expands the stack to fill available space in its parent container."
msgstr "使容器扩展以填满父容器的可用空间。"

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:73
msgid "Sizing and Layout Modifiers"
msgstr "尺寸与布局修饰器"

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:75
msgid ""
"Modifier functions wrap an ``XtkEl *`` and return the same element with "
"layout constraints attached:"
msgstr "修饰器函数接收一个 ``XtkEl *`` 并为其附加布局约束："

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:78
msgid ""
"``xtk_sized(el, width, height)`` — Constrains width, height, or both in "
"logical pixels. Include ``<math.h>`` and pass ``NAN`` for any dimension "
"that should measure from content (for example ``xtk_sized(btn, 120.0f, "
"NAN)``)."
msgstr ""
"``xtk_sized(el, width, height)`` —— 按逻辑像素指定宽度、高度或同时指定两者；引入 ``<math.h>`` 后对按内容自适应的轴传入 "
"``NAN`` （例如 ``xtk_sized(btn, 120.0f, NAN)`` ）。"

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:81
msgid ""
"``xtk_grow(el, factor)`` — Assigns Flex grow weight along the parent "
"stack's main axis. Wrapping your root container or main content pane in "
"``xtk_grow(..., 1.0f)`` stretches it to fill the window."
msgstr ""
"``xtk_grow(el, factor)`` —— 设置沿父堆栈主轴的 Flex 伸展权重。使用 ``xtk_grow(..., 1.0f)`` "
"包裹根容器或主内容区即可让它铺满窗口。"

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:84
msgid ""
"``xtk_align(el, XENT_FLEX_ALIGN_...)`` — Overrides the parent stack's "
"``.align`` for one specific child (such as right-aligning a footer button"
" in a left-aligned column via ``XENT_FLEX_ALIGN_END``)."
msgstr ""
"``xtk_align(el, XENT_FLEX_ALIGN_...)`` —— 单独覆盖某个子元素的交叉轴对齐（例如在左对齐纵列中用 "
"``XENT_FLEX_ALIGN_END`` 让底部按钮靠右对齐）。"

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:87
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``xtk_margin(el, (XentInsets) {left, top, right, bottom})`` — Adds outer "
"spacing around an element."
msgstr "``xtk_margin(el, (XentInsets) {left, top, right, bottom})`` —— 为元素四周添加外边距。"

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:89
msgid ""
"``xtk_tooltip(ui, el, \"Save Ctrl+S\")`` — Attaches a themed tooltip "
"shown on pointer hover and keyboard focus (register "
"``&flux_ctrl_tooltip``)."
msgstr "``xtk_tooltip(ui, el, \"Save Ctrl+S\")`` —— 附加鼠标悬停与键盘焦点提示框（需注册 ``&flux_ctrl_tooltip`` ）。"

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:93
msgid "Scrollable Viewports & Controlled Scrolling"
msgstr "可滚动视口与受控滚动"

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:95
msgid ""
"Wrap tall content in ``xtk_scroll`` (register ``&flux_ctrl_scroll``) to "
"gain DirectManipulation touch/trackpad inertia and themed scrollbars:"
msgstr "使用 ``xtk_scroll`` （需注册 ``&flux_ctrl_scroll`` ）包裹长页面内容，即可获得 DirectManipulation 触控板惯性滚动与主题滚动条："

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:114
msgid "Auto-Following Log Viewports"
msgstr "自动跟随底部的日志视口"

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:116
msgid ""
"``XtkScrollDesc`` also supports model-driven offsets for streaming logs "
"or chat panes:"
msgstr "``XtkScrollDesc`` 支持由 ``Model`` 驱动滚动偏移，非常适合实时构建日志或聊天消息面板："

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:119
msgid ""
"Pass ``NAN`` on an axis to leave scroll position under pure user control,"
" a pixel offset to drive it from ``Model``, or ``INFINITY`` on ``.y`` to "
"pin the viewport to the bottom as new lines arrive."
msgstr ""
"某个轴向传入 ``NAN`` 时完全交由用户滚动；传入具体像素偏移时由 ``Model`` 受控驱动；在 ``.y`` 上传入 ``INFINITY`` 时会在新行追加时自动吸附到底部。"

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:122
msgid ""
"Bind ``.scroll = xtk_msg(MSG_LOG_SCROLL)``: inside ``update()``, "
"``msg.f`` reports the vertical offset and ``msg.b`` is ``true`` whenever "
"the viewport is at the bottom, letting you pause auto-follow when the "
"user scrolls up and resume automatically when they scroll back to the "
"end:"
msgstr ""
"绑定 ``.scroll = xtk_msg(MSG_LOG_SCROLL)`` 后， ``update()`` 中的 ``msg.f`` 会收到当前纵向滚动位置，"
"而当视口贴底时 ``msg.b`` 为 ``true`` ——用户向上翻阅时自动暂停跟随，滚回底部后自动恢复跟随："

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:143
msgid "Typography & Inherited Text Styles"
msgstr "文本排版与样式继承"

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:145
msgid "``xtk_text(ui, content, desc)`` renders DirectWrite-shaped Unicode text:"
msgstr "``xtk_text(ui, content, desc)`` 使用 DirectWrite 渲染排版完整的 Unicode 文本："

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:147
msgid ""
"**Font inheritance (0.3.3)**: Leaving ``.size = 0`` or ``.weight = "
"XTK_FONT_INHERIT`` inherits font size and weight from the nearest "
"ancestor (defaulting to ``14.0f`` and ``XTK_FONT_REGULAR`` at the root). "
"Set explicit values such as ``.size = 28, .weight = XTK_FONT_SEMI_BOLD`` "
"for titles and section headers."
msgstr ""
"**字号与字重继承（0.3.3）** ：保持 ``.size = 0`` 或 ``.weight = XTK_FONT_INHERIT`` 时，"
"会自动继承最近祖先节点的字号与字重（根节点默认为 ``14.0f`` 与 ``XTK_FONT_REGULAR`` ）。标题与小节头可显式指定如 "
"``.size = 28, .weight = XTK_FONT_SEMI_BOLD`` 。"

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:152
msgid ""
"**Wrapping, truncation, and ellipsis**: Text wraps to container width by "
"default. Set ``.nowrap = true`` or ``.max_lines = 2`` together with "
"``.trim = XTK_TRIM_CHAR_ELLIPSIS``, ``XTK_TRIM_WORD_ELLIPSIS``, or "
"``XTK_TRIM_PATH_ELLIPSIS`` (ideal for long file paths)."
msgstr ""
"**自动换行、行数限制与省略号** ：文本默认按容器宽度自动折行。设置 ``.nowrap = true`` 或 ``.max_lines = 2`` "
"并配合 ``.trim = XTK_TRIM_CHAR_ELLIPSIS`` 、 ``XTK_TRIM_WORD_ELLIPSIS`` 或 ``XTK_TRIM_PATH_ELLIPSIS`` "
"（适合长文件路径中间/路径级省略）可控制截断方式。"

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:156
msgid ""
"**Selectable labels**: Set ``.selectable = true`` on read-only output, "
"error details, or log panes so users can drag-select text and copy it "
"with ``Ctrl+C``."
msgstr ""
"**可选中文本** ：在只读输出、错误详情或日志区域上设置 ``.selectable = true`` ，用户即可拖拽框选文本并按 ``Ctrl+C`` 复制。"

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:159
msgid ""
"**Colors**: Pass an ``XtkColor`` in ``.color`` (leave zero-initialized to"
" use the active Light/Dark theme's primary text brush automatically)."
msgstr "**文本颜色** ：在 ``.color`` 中传入 ``XtkColor`` （保持零初始化则自动使用当前深浅色主题的主文本画刷）。"

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:163
msgid "Images, SVG, Animated Media, & Nine-Grid"
msgstr "图像、SVG、动图与九宫格拉伸"

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:165
msgid ""
"``xtk_image`` (register ``&flux_ctrl_image``) decodes raster images, "
"animated GIF, APNG, and vector SVG off the UI thread on the background "
"thread pool:"
msgstr "``xtk_image`` （需注册 ``&flux_ctrl_image`` ）在后台线程池上异步解码位图、GIF 动图、APNG 与矢量 SVG："

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:182
msgid ""
"``flux_image_respath(path)`` interns the UTF-8 file path and returns a "
"process-lifetime ``XtkResource`` handle."
msgstr "``flux_image_respath(path)`` 对 UTF-8 文件路径做驻留并返回进程生命周期内有效的 ``XtkResource`` 资源句柄。"

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:184
msgid ""
"**Stretch modes**: ``XTK_IMAGE_UNIFORM`` (preserve aspect ratio inside "
"bounds), ``XTK_IMAGE_FILL`` (stretch to both dimensions), "
"``XTK_IMAGE_UNIFORM_TO_FILL`` (fill bounds and clip overflow), or "
"``XTK_IMAGE_NONE``. Omitting ``xtk_sized`` lets the image measure to its "
"natural pixel dimensions once its header decodes."
msgstr ""
"**缩放模式** ：支持 ``XTK_IMAGE_UNIFORM`` （保持宽高比适应边界）、 ``XTK_IMAGE_FILL`` （双向拉伸填满）、 "
"``XTK_IMAGE_UNIFORM_TO_FILL`` （等比填满并裁剪溢出部分）与 ``XTK_IMAGE_NONE`` 。省略 ``xtk_sized`` 时，"
"图像在头部异步解析完成后按其自然像素尺寸参与排版。"

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:189
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Nine-grid slicing**: Populate ``.nine = {left, top, right, bottom}`` "
"with ``XTK_IMAGE_FILL`` to keep border corners unscaled while stretching "
"edges and the center."
msgstr "**九宫格切片** ：配合 ``XTK_IMAGE_FILL`` 设置 ``.nine = {left, top, right, bottom}`` 可保持四角原尺寸并拉伸四边与中心区域。"

#: ../../source/declarative/layout.rst:192
msgid ""
"**Avatars**: ``xtk_avatar`` (register ``&flux_ctrl_avatar``) renders a "
"circular ``PersonPicture`` from ``.image``, ``.initials``, or "
"``.display_name`` with optional status badges."
msgstr ""
"**头像控件** ： ``xtk_avatar`` （需注册 ``&flux_ctrl_avatar`` ）可根据 ``.image`` 、 ``.initials`` 或 "
"``.display_name`` 渲染圆形 ``PersonPicture`` 头像及状态角标。"
